<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - FEBRUARY 19.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - FEBRUARY 19.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday saw 1,200 fixed-interest two-year bonds maturing on July 12, 1997 trading at 97.9 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 1.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
